---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const appReturnLink = 'retail://stripe-connect-return';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Return to ReTail | Stripe Payout Setup"
  description="Return to the ReTail app after completing Stripe payout setup."
  path="/stripe-connect-return"
  noindex
>
  <section class="section page-hero narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">Payout setup</span>
    <h1>Return to ReTail</h1>
    <p class="lead">Stripe sent you back to ReTail. Open the app to refresh your payout status and continue setting up your first paid listing.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href={appReturnLink}>Open ReTail</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/contact">Contact Support</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section narrow policy-body">
    <section>
      <h2>What happens next</h2>
      <p>ReTail checks your Stripe payout status from the server before paid listings can go live. If Stripe still needs information, open ReTail and continue payout setup from Settings.</p>
      <p>If the app does not open automatically, return to ReTail manually and open Profile, then Settings, then Payments &amp; Payouts.</p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
